  "raw_text": "BREWSTER, HON. HARLAN C.\u2014B. 1870; took up newspaper work in New Brunswick and Boston; removed to B. Columbia in 1897; managing dir., Clayoquot Sound Canning Co.; elec. to legis. ass. for Alberni, B. Columbia, 1907; re-elec., 1909; defeated by Sir Richard McBride, in Victoria, 1912; re-elec. at bye-elec., Mar., 1916; premier, B. Columbia, 1916.",
